\lispPackageChapter{chorus/api/macro}

These are kernel macros, defined with \texttt{defkernelmacro}.
\texttt{chorus/api} reexports them. A kernel that uses them should import or
use this package. The test \texttt{chorus/test/api/smoke} shadowing-imports
\texttt{let*}, \texttt{when}, and \texttt{unless} from here so that the kernel
body sees the kernel versions.

\lispMacroSubsection{let*}

Binds sequentially. An empty binding list expands to \texttt{progn}.

\lispSyntax

\texttt{(let* \lispVar{bindings} \&body \lispVar{body})}

\lispMacroSubsection{when}

\lispSyntax

\texttt{(when \lispVar{test} \&body \lispVar{body})}

Expands to \texttt{(if \lispVar{test} (progn \lispVar{body}))}.

\lispMacroSubsection{unless}

\lispSyntax

\texttt{(unless \lispVar{test} \&body \lispVar{body})}

Expands to \texttt{(if (not \lispVar{test}) (progn \lispVar{body}))}.
